00:36:21.014 --> 00:36:22.015
Shangó…

513
00:36:24.101 --> 00:36:25.602
God of justice.

514
00:36:27.563 --> 00:36:29.064
Orisha of thunder.

515
00:36:32.484 --> 00:36:33.902
