516
00:36:38.866 --> 00:36:41.243
Guilty.

517
00:36:41.326 --> 00:36:44.997
With capital sentences
to be carried out immediately. Fine.

518
00:36:45.080 --> 00:36:47.624
No. no. no. no! No! No!

519
00:36:47.708 --> 00:36:50.294
Max. that boy Luke
is your son with Melissa.

520
00:36:50.377 --> 00:36:52.796
