526
00:37:07.436 --> 00:37:10.439
It's the only explanation.
Last text from Noa.

527
00:37:10.939 --> 00:37:12.566
There's a certificate of home birth.

528
00:37:12.649 --> 00:37:15.235
It says that Luke Cady
was born to Crystal Cady.

529
00:37:15.319 --> 00:37:17.029
- Uh-huh.
- Yeah. but Crystal can't have kids.

530
00:37:17.112 --> 00:37:18.488
- can she? I know.
- No.

531
00:37:18.572 --> 00:37:20.073
So where did the kid come from. Max?

532
00:37:23.118 --> 00:37:24.536
- This your phone?
- Yeah.

533
00:37:27.581 --> 00:37:28.582
Open it up.

534
00:37:31.168 --> 00:37:32.252
Look at the date.

535
00:37:33.837 --> 00:37:34.880
What?

536
00:37:34.963 --> 00:37:36.924
That's right after Melissa went missing.

537
00:37:37.007 --> 00:37:38.008
Yeah.

538
00:37:39.801 --> 00:37:43.305
If Crystal can't have kids. Max.
where did she get the baby?

539
00:37:43.388 --> 00:37:45.057
Do you see the scar on his side?

540
00:37:51.980 --> 00:37:57.819
I think Crystal killed Melissa.
And she ripped him out of her.

541
00:37:59.530 --> 00:38:02.658
Your sister stole your baby. Max.

542
00:38:04.117 --> 00:38:05.536
No. no. no. no. no. no. no.

543
00:38:05.619 --> 00:38:09.373
- Yes. Luke is your baby with Melissa.
- No. that cannot…

544
00:38:09.998 --> 00:38:12.626
That boy on the boat
was your son Adam.

545
00:38:14.127 --> 00:38:16.338
and he was alive all the time
until you killed him.

546
00:38:16.421 --> 00:38:18.298
- You killed him. Max.
- No. no. no. no.

547
00:38:19.800 --> 00:38:21.426
You killed your own son.

548
00:38:21.510 --> 00:38:22.594
No!

549
00:38:23.512 --> 00:38:25.055
You killed him.

550
00:38:40.153 --> 00:38:41.780
I got it.

551
00:38:41.864 --> 00:38:43.240
Run!

552
00:39:17.024 --> 00:39:18.275
You have jury duty.

553
00:39:20.986 --> 00:39:23.363
No! No! No!

554
00:39:42.966 --> 00:39:46.053
Ah.

555
00:40:13.247 --> 00:40:16.458
- Natalie. Natalie.
- Grab the knife. Here. here…

556
00:40:18.585 --> 00:40:19.670
Nat!

557
00:40:25.175 --> 00:40:26.635
No!

558
00:40:29.179 --> 00:40:30.764
No!

559
00:40:48.282 --> 00:40:49.533
Great job.

560
00:41:14.099 --> 00:41:15.142
No.

561
00:41:16.852 --> 00:41:18.145
No.

562
00:41:19.354 --> 00:41:20.856
No!

563
00:41:26.361 --> 00:41:27.362
Shit.

564
00:41:28.197 --> 00:41:30.908
No.

565
00:41:38.790 --> 00:41:40.417
Zack. get a knife.

566
00:42:43.021 --> 00:42:44.314
Tom!

567
00:43:06.128 --> 00:43:07.462
Kill him!

568
00:43:14.553 --> 00:43:16.180
Kill him!

569
00:43:20.893 --> 00:43:21.977
Tom!

570
00:43:30.611 --> 00:43:31.987
Tom!

571
00:43:33.572 --> 00:43:34.948
Let him die in a cage.

572
00:44:43.475 --> 00:44:48.105
You all know what happened here.
in the house where Max Cady lived

573
00:44:48.188 --> 00:44:51.692
while he planned his revenge
on the lawyers who put him away.

574
00:44:52.818 --> 00:44:53.944
But what you don't know.

575
00:44:54.987 --> 00:44:56.572
what you can never know.

576
00:44:57.239 --> 00:44:59.992
is how it felt to be around Max Cady.

577
00:45:01.159 --> 00:45:03.787
To bask in the warmth of his gaze.

578
00:45:05.414 --> 00:45:06.415
But I can.

579
00:45:07.416 --> 00:45:09.042
Because I loved Max.

580
00:45:26.101 --> 00:45:27.853
Natalie. it's time to eat.

581
